2026-02-08T01:09:50: {"level":30,"time":1770534590188,"pid":2434172,"hostname":"err-Stealth-16-AI-Studio-A1VGG","reqId":"req-8m","targetUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:3001/mcp","method":"POST","contentType":"application/json","body":"{\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"_meta\":{\"openai/userAgent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\",\"openai/locale\":\"en-US\",\"openai/userLocation\":{\"city\":\"Phoenix\",\"region\":\"Arizona\",\"country\":\"US\",\"timezone\":\"America/Phoenix\",\"latitude\":\"33.44838\",\"longitude\":\"-112.07404\"},\"timezone_offset_minutes\":360,\"openai/subject\":\"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU\",\"openai/session\":\"v1/4umQx92rHGfOMES3pj5NnXGLqlPi4PynMVMDrOBbKTdddlv9jzwUl6pyRLF9MsG5PjcnEvL9bmWI\"},\"name\":\"fs_write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"spec/40-auth-and-trust.md\",\"content\":\"# MCP Migration Spec — Auth and Trust Model\\n\\n## Problem\\n`services/api-gateway` intentionally skips bearer validation for `/mcp` paths (to allow MCP resource servers to validate tokens). This means **each `services/mcp-*` service must enforce auth** unless requests are strictly internal.\\n\\n## Acceptable approaches\\n\\n### A) Downstream validates bearer tokens (recommended to match current gateway intent)\\n- All MCP services apply `requireBearerAuth` middleware.\\n- Tokens may be:\\n  - JWT (validate with JWKS)\\n  - opaque (validate via introspection or shared store)\\n\\n### B) Gateway asserts identity (works if you harden internal trust)\\n- Gateway performs auth.\\n- Gateway forwards a signed internal identity header.\\n- Downstream trusts only:\\n  - requests from the internal network / loopback proxy\\n  - headers signed with shared secret / HMAC\\n\\n## Practical recommendation\\nStart with (A) if feasible:\\n- Extract a tiny shared package: `packages/mcp-auth`\\n  - `makeBearerMiddleware({ issuerUrl, resourceMetadataUrl, requiredScopes })`\\n- Each `mcp-*` service uses it for `/mcp` GET/POST/DELETE.\\n\\n## Local/testing bypass\\nMirror the `mcp-fs-oauth` behavior:\\n- allow `ALLOW_UNAUTH_LOCAL=true` for loopback-only traffic\\n- never bypass if host is externally forwarded\\n\\n## mcp-files current state\\n`services/mcp-files` currently runs auth-free. Before routing it through gateway in production:\\n- add bearer verification or gateway-assertion checks\\n- restrict service to internal network\\n\\n\",\"message\":\"Add MCP migration spec docs\",\"backend\":\"local\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"2219","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"e4372072-c2cb-4410-88a0-db6e5f0fb496","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-69883691000000006f56fab5dce13c10-4f38891619c8a321-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:2bc781940118e209;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"12181687680690216353","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=6988369100000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"8022875445208890384","x-forwarded-for":"172.212.159.77","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/4umQx92rHGfOMES3pj5NnXGLqlPi4PynMVMDrOBbKTdddlv9jzwUl6pyRLF9MsG5PjcnEvL9bmWI","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
