2026-02-08T01:10:22: {"level":30,"time":1770534622823,"pid":2434172,"hostname":"err-Stealth-16-AI-Studio-A1VGG","reqId":"req-8q","targetUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:3001/mcp","method":"POST","contentType":"application/json","body":"{\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"_meta\":{\"openai/userAgent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\",\"openai/locale\":\"en-US\",\"openai/userLocation\":{\"city\":\"Phoenix\",\"region\":\"Arizona\",\"country\":\"US\",\"timezone\":\"America/Phoenix\",\"latitude\":\"33.44838\",\"longitude\":\"-112.07404\"},\"timezone_offset_minutes\":360,\"openai/subject\":\"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU\",\"openai/session\":\"v1/4umQx92rHGfOMES3pj5NnXGLqlPi4PynMVMDrOBbKTdddlv9jzwUl6pyRLF9MsG5PjcnEvL9bmWI\"},\"name\":\"fs_write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"spec/50-tool-id-compat.md\",\"content\":\"# MCP Migration Spec — Tool ID Compatibility\\n\\n## Why this matters\\nWorkflows and clients often reference tools by **tool ID**. The legacy monolith uses IDs like `files_list_directory` while the migrated FS services expose `fs_list`.\\n\\nBreaking tool IDs breaks:\\n- existing workflow specs\\n- saved configurations\\n- clients that hardcode tool names\\n\\n## Strategy\\nProvide aliases during migration.\\n\\n### Alias rule\\nFor each affected tool, register both:\\n- the new canonical ID (preferred)\\n- the legacy ID (alias)\\n\\nExample (files):\\n- `fs_list` (canonical)\\n- `files_list_directory` (alias) → calls the same implementation\\n\\n## Required alias mappings\\n\\n### Files\\n- `files_list_directory` → `fs_list`\\n- `files_view_file` → `fs_read`\\n- `files_write_content` → `fs_write` (content)\\n- `files_write_lines` → `fs_write` (line-edit mode, if supported)\\n- `files_tree_directory` → `fs_tree`\\n- `files_search` → `fs_grep` or `fs_search`\\n\\n## Deprecation\\nOnce workflows are updated, legacy IDs can be removed in stages:\\n1. Log warnings on legacy IDs\\n2. Document replacement\\n3. Remove after a defined cutoff\\n\\n\",\"message\":\"Add MCP migration spec docs\",\"backend\":\"local\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"1845","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"990b8d54-e73a-47eb-a68c-7f203addb68c","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-698836db00000000e39dacbe6e0e649b-c6d4927418ab9097-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:00706386b4f2122b;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"2311293501980171087","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=698836db00000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"16401455351843415195","x-forwarded-for":"172.212.159.66","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/4umQx92rHGfOMES3pj5NnXGLqlPi4PynMVMDrOBbKTdddlv9jzwUl6pyRLF9MsG5PjcnEvL9bmWI","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
