2026-02-08T01:10:41: {"level":30,"time":1770534641162,"pid":2434172,"hostname":"err-Stealth-16-AI-Studio-A1VGG","reqId":"req-8u","targetUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:3001/mcp","method":"POST","contentType":"application/json","body":"{\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"_meta\":{\"openai/userAgent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\",\"openai/locale\":\"en-US\",\"openai/userLocation\":{\"city\":\"Phoenix\",\"region\":\"Arizona\",\"country\":\"US\",\"timezone\":\"America/Phoenix\",\"latitude\":\"33.44838\",\"longitude\":\"-112.07404\"},\"timezone_offset_minutes\":360,\"openai/subject\":\"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU\",\"openai/session\":\"v1/4umQx92rHGfOMES3pj5NnXGLqlPi4PynMVMDrOBbKTdddlv9jzwUl6pyRLF9MsG5PjcnEvL9bmWI\"},\"name\":\"fs_write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"spec/60-service-blueprint.md\",\"content\":\"# MCP Migration Spec — Service Blueprint\\n\\nThis describes the expected structure and behavior for each `services/mcp-*` service.\\n\\n## Directory layout\\n```\\nservices/mcp-<name>/\\n  src/\\n    main.ts\\n    tools/\\n  package.json\\n  tsconfig.json\\n  config/\\n```\\n\\n## Runtime contract\\n- HTTP server exposes:\\n  - `GET /health` → `{ ok: true, service: \\\"mcp-<name>\\\" }`\\n  - MCP at `/mcp`:\\n    - `POST /mcp` (JSON body)\\n    - `GET /mcp` (session)\\n    - `DELETE /mcp` (session)\\n\\n- Required headers:\\n  - forward/echo `mcp-session-id`\\n  - support `text/event-stream` streaming\\n\\n## Auth\\n- Apply bearer middleware to `/mcp` routes.\\n- Allow local bypass only for loopback-only traffic (see `spec/40-auth-and-trust.md`).\\n\\n## Tool registration\\n- Register tools with stable IDs (see `spec/10-tool-inventory.md`).\\n- Add aliases where required (see `spec/50-tool-id-compat.md`).\\n\\n## Shared code\\nPrefer shared packages over copy/paste:\\n- `@workspace/mcp-runtime` for HTTP router and server helpers\\n- `packages/mcp-auth` for bearer verification\\n\\n## Operational notes\\n- Keep logs structured and include correlation ids from gateway.\\n- Keep timeouts consistent with gateway proxy behavior (gateway uses 30s upstream timeout).\\n\\n\",\"message\":\"Add MCP migration spec docs\",\"backend\":\"local\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"1954","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"0d512bd1-0d00-4fad-96c0-85d0e6a220c5","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-698836db00000000e39dacbe6e0e649b-ddf62567d0dda8ff-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:45d4b0bc2b8544ff;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"16061342534124825500","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=698836db00000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"16401455351843415195","x-forwarded-for":"172.212.159.73","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/4umQx92rHGfOMES3pj5NnXGLqlPi4PynMVMDrOBbKTdddlv9jzwUl6pyRLF9MsG5PjcnEvL9bmWI","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
